# AIFS Master Functional Blueprint
**Features, Options, Text, and Buttons for All 60 Screens**

---

## SECTION A: PUBLIC WEBSITE

### A1. Home Page
*   **Features & Options:** Sticky navigation, mobile hamburger menu, hero section, side-by-side comparison (Traditional vs AI), Pain Points grid, 3-column Transformation (Become/Learn/Gain), 5-Phase Curriculum timeline, Dynamic course/live class carousels, Testimonial slider, Student project video grid.
*   **Text:** 
    *   *Menu:* Home | Courses | Curriculum | Live Classes | Examples | Instructors | Reviews | FAQ
    *   *Hero:* "Master AI Filmmaking", "Create Shorts, Films, Ads, YouTube Videos & Bring Your Creative Vision to Life!"
    *   *Comparison:* "Why AI Filmmaking is the Future?" (Traditional: Months/years, high cost vs AI: Weeks/days, low cost, endless iteration).
    *   *Pain Points:* "This Program is for You If… You have strong ideas but struggle to execute them with AI."
    *   *Transformation:* "What You’ll Become? What You’ll Learn? What You’ll Gain?"
*   **Buttons (CTAs):** `[ Sign In ]`, `[ Join a Free Masterclass ]`, `[ Explore Courses ]`, `[ Enrol Now ]`, `[ Reserve Seat ]`

### A2. Courses Catalogue
*   **Features & Options:** Search bar (by keyword, tutor), Filter sidebar (Category, Language, Difficulty, Price, Format - Live/Recorded), Sort dropdown (Newest, Price, Rating), Grid of course cards, Pagination.
*   **Text:** "Explore Our AI Filmmaking Courses", "Find the perfect program to master your craft."
*   **Buttons:** `[ Apply Filters ]`, `[ Clear All ]`, `[ View Course ]` on cards, `[ Load More ]`

### A3. Course Detail Page
*   **Features & Options:** Course preview video player, Tabbed layout (Overview, Curriculum, Reviews, Instructor), Sticky pricing/enrollment sidebar, Progress indicators for curriculum (locked/preview icons).
*   **Text:** Course Title, "What you will learn" (bullet points), Requirements, Detailed module descriptions, Refund policy short-text, Certificate criteria.
*   **Buttons:** `[ Buy Now (INR) ]`, `[ Watch Free Preview ]`, `[ Add to Wishlist ]`, `[ Share ]`

### A4. Curriculum (Dedicated View)
*   **Features & Options:** Expandable/collapsible accordion of all 5 Phases and their respective modules/lessons. Badges showing video duration and format (Text/Video/Quiz).
*   **Text:** "The 5-Phase AIFS System", Module Titles, Lesson descriptions.
*   **Buttons:** `[ Expand All ]`, `[ Collapse All ]`

### A5. Live Classes Page
*   **Features & Options:** Calendar view or list view of upcoming live batches, Timezone auto-converter (defaults to IST), Filter by Instructor/Topic.
*   **Text:** "Upcoming Live Batches", "Learn in real-time with industry experts."
*   **Buttons:** `[ Reserve Seat ]`, `[ Notify Me ]` (if full)

### A6. Examples / Student Projects
*   **Features & Options:** Masonry video grid, Filter by category (Ad, Short Film, YouTube Video), Modal video player.
*   **Text:** "Real Films by Real Students", "See what you can create after 30 days."
*   **Buttons:** `[ Play Video ]`, `[ View Student Profile ]`

### A7. Instructors (Directory & Profile)
*   **Features & Options:** Grid of instructors. Clicking opens a profile with their bio, social links, and a list of courses they teach.
*   **Text:** "Meet Your Mentors", Instructor Bio, "Total Students", "Average Rating".
*   **Buttons:** `[ View Profile ]`, `[ Browse Instructor's Courses ]`

### A8. Reviews / Wall of Love
*   **Features & Options:** Infinite scroll of text and video testimonials, average platform rating widget.
*   **Text:** "Hear From Our Students", Star ratings, specific quotes about the 5-phase system.
*   **Buttons:** `[ Read More ]`, `[ Play Video Review ]`

### A9. FAQ Page
*   **Features & Options:** Categorized accordions (General, Payments, Courses, Technical).
*   **Text:** Questions like "Do I need prior experience?", "What AI tools are covered?" and detailed answers.
*   **Buttons:** `[ Still need help? Contact Support ]`

### A10. Memberships
*   **Features & Options:** Pricing table comparison (Monthly vs Annual toggle), Feature checklist with check/cross icons.
*   **Text:** "Unlock All-Access Learning", "Choose Your Membership Plan" (e.g., Studio Plan vs Director Plan).
*   **Buttons:** `[ Subscribe Monthly ]`, `[ Subscribe Annually - Save 20% ]`

### A11. Resources / Blog
*   **Features & Options:** Article grid, Category tags (Prompt Engineering, Case Studies, Updates), Search bar.
*   **Text:** "AI Filmmaking Insights", Article titles, excerpts, Author names.
*   **Buttons:** `[ Read Article ]`

### A12. Become a Tutor
*   **Features & Options:** Application form (File upload for portfolio, Text areas for bio), Benefits section.
*   **Text:** "Teach the Future of Filmmaking", "Earn commission on every enrollment."
*   **Buttons:** `[ Submit Application ]`

### A13. About & Contact
*   **Features & Options:** Contact form (Name, Email, Subject, Message), Google Map embed, Social links.
*   **Text:** Mission statement, "India's first AI Filmmaking Studio LMS", Support email, WhatsApp number.
*   **Buttons:** `[ Send Message ]`

### A14. Auth & Legal (Sign Up, Sign In, Passwords, Policies)
*   **Features & Options:** Email/Password inputs, Google OAuth, Show/hide password toggle, Rich text for legal pages.
*   **Text:** "Welcome Back", "Create an Account", Terms of Service, Privacy Policy.
*   **Buttons:** `[ Sign In ]`, `[ Continue with Google ]`, `[ Forgot Password? ]`, `[ Reset Password ]`

