## SECTION B: STUDENT DASHBOARD

### B1. Dashboard Home
*   **Features & Options:** Welcome banner, Resume last course widget, Mini-calendar for upcoming live classes, Notification bell.
*   **Text:** "Welcome back, [Name]", "Your Progress", "Announcements".
*   **Buttons:** `[ Continue Learning ]`, `[ Join Zoom Class ]`

### B2. My Courses
*   **Features & Options:** Filter tabs (All, In Progress, Completed), Progress bars for each course.
*   **Text:** Course titles, "% Completed", "Last Accessed".
*   **Buttons:** `[ Start Course ]`, `[ Resume ]`

### B3. Learning Player
*   **Features & Options:** Custom video player (speed control, CC, full screen), Sidebar with module navigation, Tabs under video (Overview, Downloads, Q&A, Notes).
*   **Text:** Lesson Title, Lesson text content, Downloadable file names.
*   **Buttons:** `[ Mark as Complete & Next ]`, `[ Previous ]`, `[ Ask Question ]`, `[ Save Note ]`

### B4. Live Batches & B5. Recordings Library
*   **Features & Options:** List of enrolled batches, Countdown timer to next class, Grid of past recordings.
*   **Text:** Batch Schedule (IST), "Recording expires in X days".
*   **Buttons:** `[ Join Live (Zoom) ]`, `[ Watch Recording ]`, `[ Add to Calendar ]`

### B6. Assignments & B7. Quizzes
*   **Features & Options:** Upload area for files/links, Grader feedback view, Timer for quizzes, Multiple choice selection.
*   **Text:** "Assignment Instructions", "Due Date", "Tutor Feedback", "Quiz Score".
*   **Buttons:** `[ Submit Assignment ]`, `[ Start Quiz ]`, `[ Retake Quiz ]`

### B8. Certificates
*   **Features & Options:** Grid of earned certificates, PDF generator, LinkedIn share integration.
*   **Text:** "Verified Credentials", Issue Date, Course Name.
*   **Buttons:** `[ Download PDF ]`, `[ Add to LinkedIn ]`, `[ Copy Public Link ]`

### B9. Orders, B10. Community, B11. Support, B12. Settings
*   **Features & Options:** Invoice table, WhatsApp group links, Ticketing system (Create/Reply), Profile editor (Avatar upload, Password change).
*   **Text:** Order IDs, Payment Status, "Join Community Group", Ticket Status (Open/Resolved), Notification toggles.
*   **Buttons:** `[ Download Invoice ]`, `[ Open WhatsApp ]`, `[ Create Ticket ]`, `[ Save Changes ]`

